{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いて下さりありがとうございます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 増本綺良です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2日間、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミーグリ＆サイン会ありがとうございましたー！✨️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都で送って頂いたお花🌼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日🌼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日は雨、今日は強風でしたね、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな天気の中でも会いに来て下さって嬉しかったです😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またお話しましょうね🙌"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリの時はいつも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メイクさんが髪型と髪飾りをおそろいにしようとしてくれます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "断ろうとすると残念な顔をされるので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒の髪型になっていることが多いです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫の服"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-04.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "松田さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前髪流してるの可愛い♡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-05.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "武元さんが履いているズボン、ずっと可愛い可愛いって言ってたら譲ってくれました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて優しい。ありがとう"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-06.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫耳"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/1af/3e895dda89b0023d0b84531d270a2-07.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モモミさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真撮りましょうって誘ってくれたので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮りたい理由とメリットと熱意をプレゼンしてくれたらいいよ！と言ったらちゃんと全部語ってくれました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "面白いので、目をつけています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "BACKS LIVE!!まであと1週間ですね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハーサル頑張ります👊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んで下さりありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "増本綺良(きらこ)"}], "source": "official"}